#: ../../10-runbook.md:5 394beaea75b549e3a1095ea36e047657
msgid ""
"Ops after a working install. First-time bootstrap, Autotools, and package "
"install live in [Quick Start](01-quick-start.md). Pipelines and prefix "
"layout live in [Build](08-build.md)."
msgstr ""
"安装可用之后的运维。首次 bootstrap、Autotools 与软件包安装见 [快速开始](01-quick-"
"start.md)。流水线与前缀目录布局见 [构建](08-build.md)。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:7 7e526caf07684ff8b9764397b5765103
msgid ""
"Vanilla XML is a **demo PBX**, not a production baseline "
"(`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`). Change SIP/VM passwords (or run "
"`scripts/perl/randomize-passwords.pl`) and the ESL password before any "
"public IP."
msgstr ""
"Vanilla XML 是一套 **演示 "
"PBX**，不是生产基线（`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`）。在绑定任何公网 IP 之前，请修改 "
"SIP/语音信箱密码（或运行 `scripts/perl/randomize-passwords.pl`）以及 ESL 密码。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:9 5b4cd6204e854811b137ec65c4cbf3b3
msgid ""
"`$PREFIX` below is the configure prefix. Developer path in this PKB: "
"`\"$HOME/fs\"`. Autotools default without `--prefix`: "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch` (`configure.ac`). Debian packages use FHS paths (see"
" [Inspect Local State](#inspect-local-state))."
msgstr ""
"下文 `$PREFIX` 指 configure 安装前缀。本 PKB 的开发者路径：`\"$HOME/fs\"`。未指定 `--prefix` 时 "
"Autotools 默认为 `/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。Debian 软件包使用 FHS 路径（见 "
"[检查本地状态](#inspect-local-state)）。"

