#: ../../10-runbook.md:71 cd84f9eefe6e41aaa8a066f06456cec2
msgid ""
"That drops `core.db`, Sofia registration DBs (`sofia_reg_internal.db`, "
"`sofia_reg_external.db`), and other module SQLite files under `$PREFIX/db/` "
"(`src/switch_core_db.c` names them `$dbdir/<dsn>.db`)."
