#: ../../10-runbook.md:82 5a21075bf2264552bb1eb3e23a54904f
msgid ""
"Unit start line: `/usr/bin/freeswitch -u freeswitch -g freeswitch -ncwait "
"-nonat`. `PIDFile=/run/freeswitch/freeswitch.pid`. `DAEMON_OPTS=-nonat` "
"unless `/etc/default/freeswitch` overrides it."
msgstr ""
"Unit 启动行：`/usr/bin/freeswitch -u freeswitch -g freeswitch -ncwait "
"-nonat`。`PIDFile=/run/freeswitch/freeswitch.pid`。除非 "
"`/etc/default/freeswitch` 覆盖，否则 `DAEMON_OPTS=-nonat`。"

