#: ../../10-runbook.md:139 7609adcca6954857a20e22e9c3292c76
msgid ""
"After XML edits: `fs_cli -x reloadxml`. Directory and dialplan changes apply"
" on the **next** call. Sofia bind/codec/gateway XML needs `sofia profile "
"internal rescan` (or restart); ACL lists need `reloadacl`. `reloadxml` does "
"**not** load/unload modules — use `load` / `unload` / `reload mod_name` "
"([Chapter "
"5](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/module-"
"loading/))."
msgstr ""
"改完 XML 后执行 `fs_cli -x reloadxml`。号码簿与拨号计划在**下一通**呼叫生效。Sofia 绑定/编解码/网关 XML 需要"
" `sofia profile internal rescan`（或重启）；ACL 列表需要 `reloadacl`。`reloadxml` "
"**不会**加载/卸载模块 — 用 `load` / `unload` / `reload mod_name`（[第 5 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/module-"
"loading/)）。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:141 82588db7b42c4d76a441be031cad9aac
msgid ""
"Vanilla SIP ports (`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`): internal **5060** / TLS "
"**5061**, external **5080** / TLS **5081**. RTP default range "
"**16384–32768** (`src/switch_rtp.c`; commented overrides in "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml`). Docker also documents UDP "
"**64535–65535**."
msgstr ""
"Vanilla SIP 端口（`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`）：内部 **5060** / TLS **5061**，外部 "
"**5080** / TLS **5081**。RTP 默认范围 "
"**16384–32768**（`src/switch_rtp.c`；`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml`"
" 中有注释掉的覆盖项）。Docker 还记录了 UDP **64535–65535**。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:143 6d16b8fe50834525a433794f71f5031e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Directory users **1000–1019** exist under `conf/vanilla/directory/` with "
"shared password `1234` (`$${default_password}` in `vars.xml`) — do not "
"expose 5060/8021 on a public IP. First-call numbers (`9196` echo, `4000` "
"voicemail, …): [Quick Start](01-quick-start.md)."
msgstr ""
"`conf/vanilla/directory/` 下存在分机 **1000–1019**，共享密码 `1234`（`vars.xml` 中的 "
"`$${default_password}`）— 不要把 5060/8021 暴露到公网 IP。首呼号码（`9196` 回声、`4000` "
"语音信箱等）见 [快速开始](01-quick-start.md)。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:145 b144cf958fd34db7ab426aa5a8ea9af8
msgid "Debugging Notes"
msgstr "调试说明"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:147 4caf4314e35641ff8e0d672e60acd5ff
msgid ""
"**CLI / ESL**: `fs_cli` first. If it cannot connect, the process is down, "
"ESL is not on 8021, or `mod_event_socket` did not load. Default client "
"target is loopback (`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`)."
msgstr ""
"**CLI / ESL**：先用 `fs_cli`。若连不上，则进程未起来、ESL 不在 8021，或 `mod_event_socket` "
"未加载。客户端默认目标是回环（`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`）。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:148 641cd06b078249ff8bf10a5da99bf263
msgid ""
"**Runtime / SIP**: `$PREFIX/log/freeswitch.log` and console mappings. SIP "
"trace: `fs_cli -x \"sofia profile internal siptrace on\"` (keybinding 10 in "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml`). NAT surprises: you started"
" without `-nonat`."
msgstr ""
"**运行时 / SIP**：`$PREFIX/log/freeswitch.log` 与控制台映射。SIP 跟踪：`fs_cli -x \"sofia "
"profile internal siptrace "
"on\"`（`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml` 中快捷键 10）。NAT 异常：启动时未加 "
"`-nonat`。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:149 9730061bbea34e04a9420b8b5be0c727
msgid ""
"**Data / persistence**: core scoreboard is SQLite under `$PREFIX/db/` "
"(`src/switch_core_sqldb.c`). `show channels` / `show calls` read that "
"projection; the session thread is source of truth ([Data and API](05-data-"
"and-api.md)). Wipe `*.db` only while stopped."
msgstr ""
"**数据 / 持久化**：核心记分板是 `$PREFIX/db/` 下的 SQLite（`src/switch_core_sqldb.c`）。`show"
" channels` / `show calls` 读的是该投影；会话线程才是真相来源（[数据与 API](05-data-and-"
"api.md)）。仅在停止后清理 `*.db`。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:151 4b61841b53de4631a4995eb2da11d600
msgid ""
"Log verbosity: `fs_cli -x \"console loglevel debug\"`; file logger maps "
"`all` to `console,debug,info,notice,warning,err,crit,alert` in vanilla "
"`logfile.conf.xml`. Rotate: `fs_cli -x \"fsctl send_sighup\"` (`rotate-on-"
"hup` is `true`)."
msgstr ""
"日志详细程度：`fs_cli -x \"console loglevel debug\"`；文件记录器在 vanilla "
"`logfile.conf.xml` 中把 `all` 映射到 "
"`console,debug,info,notice,warning,err,crit,alert`。轮转：`fs_cli -x \"fsctl "
"send_sighup\"`（`rotate-on-hup` 为 `true`）。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:153 02f775bd1014445ea0d4e9a597c2b694
msgid "Deeper log/metrics layout: [Observability](11-observability.md)."
msgstr "更深入的日志/指标布局：[可观测性](11-observability.md)。"

